.SH NAME
.PP
stochasticlenssimulatormkii-by-gzrrplox - the command to run Stochastic
Lens Simulator Mk II.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
stochasticlenssimulatormkii-by-gzrrplox [\f[I]options\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Stochastic Lens Simulator Mk II is a 4k intro released by Gzrrplox in
may 2011, at Stream Eight.
Ended 4th at Stream 2011.
.PP
The intro starts in a 960x600 window and stops by itself at the end.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
there is no options to this program
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]F\f[R]
toggle fullscreen, using the desktop resolution (the aspect ratio is
kept)
.TP
\f[B]Escape\f[R], \f[B]Q\f[R]
quit
